        "language": "en",
        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><h1>Hospital discharge report: Bertil Åkesson, Landspítali, 9 to 20 November 2026</h1><p><b>Discharge diagnosis:</b> Displaced fracture of the right femoral neck, Garden IV (S72.0), treated with a cemented bipolar hemiarthroplasty on 10 November 2026. Postoperative anaemia, not transfused</p></div>"
        },
