              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Result</th><th>Date</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Haemoglobin</td><td>102 g/L</td><td>2026-11-18</td></tr><tr><td>Creatinine</td><td>136 umol/L</td><td>2026-11-18</td></tr><tr><td>eGFR (CKD-EPI 2021)</td><td>42 mL/min/1.73m2</td><td>2026-11-18</td></tr><tr><td>Potassium</td><td>4.1 mmol/L</td><td>2026-11-18</td></tr><tr><td>CRP</td><td>38 mg/L</td><td>2026-11-18</td></tr></tbody></table><p><b>Pending results:</b> None. Haemoglobin 102 g/L (128 on admission) and creatinine 136 µmol/L on 18 November: recheck both one week after discharge</p></div>"
