              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><p>Walks about 50 m indoors with his own rollator, full weight bearing. Stairs only with support and a handrail. Needs help with lower-body dressing and compression stockings. Independent eating and hygiene above table height</p></div>"
