            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><p><b>Changes:</b> Apixaban paused on admission for surgery and restarted on 12 November, unchanged dose. New: paracetamol 1 g three times daily for 14 days, until 24 November. Everything else unchanged. Blood glucose up to 14 mmol/L on insulin glargine</p><ul><li>Paracetamol 1 g tablet</li></ul></div>"
