            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" lang=\"en\" xml:lang=\"en\"><p><b>Planned discharge:</b> 20 November 2026</p><p><b>Travel home:</b> Adapted vehicle or taxi with escort, fit-to-travel certificate issued</p><p><b>Care needs after discharge:</b> Home care; Rehabilitation and physiotherapy; Assistive devices; Wound care; Help with medication; Blood glucose monitoring; Anticoagulation follow-up</p><p><b>Responsible doctor:</b> Yfirlæknir Guðrún Jónsdóttir, Orthopaedic Surgery, Landspítali; 24/7 +354 543 1000, orthopaedic doctor on call</p><p><b>Remarks:</b> Skin staples out on 24 November. Rehabilitation plan (endurhæfingaráætlun) attached for Sjöbacka kommun; operation note and lab and X-ray report attached</p></div>"
            }
